 "note_en": "再……也…… means \"no matter how much... still...\": 怕自己再努力也改不好 \"afraid that no matter how hard I try, I still won't get it right.\" Here 再 doesn't mean \"again\"; paired with 也, it means \"however much,\" and the same pattern appears in 日子再难，也得一点一点往前走 \"however hard life gets, you have to keep moving forward bit by bit.\"",
